            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="4"><DEFINITION><ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>ad-fid</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF></DEFINITION></ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
